From 17d656052d7828686351d1d6889e6e458b2a9117 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: yangsonglin13 <yangsonglin566@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 14 Sep 2026 19:35:14 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 5/7] fix(rfork): integrate model and worker lifecycle

Carry load-derived model state through RFork transfers, finalize deferred draft sharing before seed publication, and coordinate RFork with MoE storage rewrites, quantization runtime caches, DSpark rotation, and mutable-weight worker operations. Keep the coupled RFork loader, load-state, safety, model, worker, and final regression-test changes together so this integration is reviewable and usable as one commit.

Signed-off-by: yangsonglin13 <yangsonglin566@gmail.com>
