 msgid ""
-"To enable RFork, pass `--load-format rfork` and provide RFork settings "
-"through `--model-loader-extra-config` as a JSON string."
+"- the **planner**, which tracks seeds, health, capacity, and transfer leases;\n"
+"- the **seed instance**, which registers and advertises live NPU weights;\n"
+"- the **destination instance**, which prepares matching local buffers;\n"
+"- **YuanRong TransferEngine**, which transfers bytes between the two instances."
 msgstr ""
-"要启用 RFork，请传递 `--load-format rfork` 并通过 `--model-loader-extra-config` 以 JSON"
-" 字符串形式提供 RFork 设置。"
-
-msgid "### RFork Prerequisites"
-msgstr "### RFork 前提条件"
+"- **调度器**，跟踪种子实例、健康状态、容量和传输租约；\n"
+"- **种子实例**，注册并发布当前 NPU 权重；\n"
+"- **目标实例**，准备匹配的本地缓冲区；\n"
+"- **元戎 TransferEngine**，在两个实例之间传输字节数据。"
 
 msgid ""
-"- Install the runtime dependency `YuanRong TransferEngine` on every RFork instance.\n"
-"- Run a planner service that implements the RFork seed protocol. A simple mock planner script is provided at [`rfork_planner.py`](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/blob/main/examples/rfork/rfork_planner.py)."
+"Each TP/PP/EP worker owns an independent RFork session and exchanges only its\n"
+"local shard. The seed HTTP service carries metadata; tensor data travels through\n"
+"TransferEngine."
 msgstr ""
-"- 在每个 RFork 实例上安装运行时依赖 `YuanRong TransferEngine`。\n"
-"- 运行一个实现 RFork seed 协议的规划器服务。一个简单的模拟规划器脚本位于 [`rfork_planner.py`](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/blob/main/examples/rfork/rfork_planner.py)。"
-
-msgid "### Configuration Fields"
-msgstr "### 配置字段"
+"每个 TP/PP/EP worker 都拥有独立的 RFork 会话，并且只交换自身的本地分片。种子 HTTP 服务\n"
+"传递元数据，张量数据则通过 TransferEngine 传输。"
 
-msgid "### How RFork Matches Seeds"
-msgstr "### RFork 如何匹配 Seeds"
+msgid "The destination performs these steps:"
+msgstr "目标实例执行以下步骤："
 
 msgid ""
-"RFork does not match instances by `model_url` alone. The local seed key is "
-"composed from:"
-msgstr "RFork 不单独通过 `model_url` 匹配实例。本地 seed 键由以下部分组成："
-
-msgid ""
-"- `model_url`\n"
-"- `model_deploy_strategy_name`\n"
-"- disaggregation mode derived from `kv_transfer_config.kv_role` or `kv_both`\n"
-"- `node_rank`\n"
-"- `pp_rank` when pipeline parallel size is greater than 1\n"
-"- `tp_rank`\n"
-"- `ep_rank` when expert parallelism is enabled for an MoE model\n"
-"- optional `draft` suffix when the worker runs as a draft model"
+"1. Build a compatibility key and initialize the model on NPU.\n"
+"2. Prepare the required tensor layout and register destination memory.\n"
+"3. Acquire one seed lease, fetch its manifest, validate every tensor, and read\n"
+"   the weights in bounded batches.\n"
+"4. Release the source lease asynchronously, finish post-load processing, and\n"
+"   switch the model to evaluation mode.\n"
+"5. Register and advertise the loaded model as another seed when cleanup and\n"
+"   lease state allow it."
 msgstr ""
-"- `model_url`\n"
-"- `model_deploy_strategy_name`\n"
-"- 从 `kv_transfer_config.kv_role` 或 `kv_both` 派生的分离模式\n"
-"- `node_rank`\n"
-"- 当流水线并行大小大于 1 时的 `pp_rank`\n"
-"- `tp_rank`\n"
-"- 当 MoE 模型启用专家并行时的 `ep_rank`\n"
-"- 当工作器作为草稿模型运行时的可选 `draft` 后缀"
+"1. 构建兼容性键，并在 NPU 上初始化模型。\n"
+"2. 准备所需的张量布局并注册目标端内存。\n"
+"3. 获取一个种子租约和对应清单，校验每个张量，再按有界批次读取权重。\n"
+"4. 异步释放源端租约，完成加载后处理，并将模型切换为评估模式。\n"
+"5. 清理和租约状态允许时，将已加载模型注册并发布为另一个种子实例。"
 
 msgid ""
-"This means two instances must agree on both model identity and deployment topology before the planner will treat them as interchangeable seeds.\n"
-"For deployments without pipeline or expert parallelism, the existing seed-key format is unchanged."
+"If no compatible seed is available, or transfer fails, RFork unregisters the\n"
+"prepared memory and uses the default loader. It refuses to allocate a second\n"
+"model if cleanup cannot prove that the old registered memory is safe to release.\n"
+"A failed seed-service startup does not discard a successfully loaded model."
 msgstr ""
-"这意味着两个实例必须在模型标识和部署拓扑上达成一致，规划器才会将它们视为可互换的 seed。\n"
-"对于没有流水线或专家并行的部署，现有的 seed 键格式保持不变。"
+"如果没有可用的兼容种子实例，或传输失败，RFork 会注销已准备的内存并使用默认加载器。\n"
+"如果清理过程无法确认旧注册内存可以安全释放，RFork 会拒绝分配第二个模型。种子服务启动失败\n"
+"不会丢弃已经成功加载的模型。"
 
-msgid "### Quantized Models"
-msgstr "### 量化模型"
+msgid "## Lifecycle guarantees"
+msgstr "## 生命周期保证"
 
 msgid ""
-"For quantized models, RFork transfers tensors after Ascend weight post-"
-"processing instead of raw checkpoint parameters. The receiver first builds "
-"the same post-load tensor layout as the seed, then RFork copies the live NPU"
-" tensors used by inference."
+"`RForkSession` owns the planner lease, TransferEngine, registered tensor owners,\n"
+"seed HTTP service, heartbeat, and shutdown state. Memory remains pinned while a\n"
+"seed may still be read. Cleanup stops heartbeats, removes the advertisement,\n"
+"stops the HTTP server, unregisters memory, and only then finalizes\n"
+"TransferEngine."
 msgstr ""
-"对于量化模型，RFork 在 Ascend 权重后处理之后传输张量，而不是原始检查点参数。接收方首先构建与 seed 相同的加载后张量布局，然后 "
-"RFork 复制推理使用的活跃 NPU 张量。"
+"`RForkSession` 管理调度器租约、TransferEngine、已注册张量的所有者、种子 HTTP 服务、\n"
+"心跳和关闭状态。只要种子实例仍可能被读取，内存就会保持固定。清理时会依次停止心跳、移除发布信息、\n"
+"停止 HTTP 服务并注销内存，最后才终止 TransferEngine。"
 
 msgid ""
-"This path handles Ascend quantization changes such as weight transposition, "
-"NZ format conversion, packed weights, derived scale tensors, and MLA/SFA "
-"runtime tensors such as `W_UV` and `W_UK_T`. Empty tensors that were "
-"released during post-processing are not included in the transfer manifest."
+"Lease release uses bounded background retries. Network errors, HTTP 408/429,\n"
+"and 5xx responses are retryable; other rejected responses stop immediately.\n"
+"HTTP 200 and 404 are treated as acknowledged releases. An unresolved lease\n"
+"delays seed publication without blocking inference, but shutdown retains the\n"
+"TransferEngine resources rather than freeing memory prematurely."
 msgstr ""
-"此路径处理 Ascend 量化更改，例如权重转置、NZ 格式转换、压缩权重、派生缩放张量以及 MLA/SFA 运行时张量（如 `W_UV` 和 "
-"`W_UK_T`）。后处理期间释放的空张量不包含在传输清单中。"
-
-msgid "When validating RFork for a quantized model:"
-msgstr "验证量化模型的 RFork 时："
+"租约释放会在后台进行有次数上限的重试。网络错误、HTTP 408/429 和 5xx 响应可重试；\n"
+"其他拒绝响应会立即停止重试。HTTP 200 和 404 均视为释放已确认。未解决的租约会延迟种子发布，\n"
+"但不会阻塞推理；关闭时会保留 TransferEngine 资源，避免过早释放内存。"
 
 msgid ""
-"- Apply the same vLLM Ascend code to both the seed instance and the receiver instance.\n"
-"- Restart the planner and all vLLM instances after changing RFork code, because existing seeds keep their old transfer metadata.\n"
-"- Use a new `model_deploy_strategy_name` after changing model arguments or RFork code, so the planner does not match a receiver with an incompatible old seed.\n"
-"- A successful RFork transfer logs `transfer weights starts` and `transfer weights time`. The fallback path logs `RFork transfer failed`."
+"Fallback restores vLLM compilation registries, compiler hooks, MoE registries,\n"
+"and rotary caches to their pre-attempt state before the default loader\n"
+"constructs another model. Model construction and rollback are assumed to be\n"
+"serialized within each worker."
 msgstr ""
-"- 对 seed 实例和接收方实例应用相同的 vLLM Ascend 代码。\n"
-"- 更改 RFork 代码后重新启动规划器和所有 vLLM 实例，因为现有的 seed 会保留其旧的传输元数据。\n"
-"- 更改模型参数或 RFork 代码后使用新的 `model_deploy_strategy_name`，这样规划器就不会将接收方与不兼容的旧 seed 匹配。\n"
-"- 成功的 RFork 传输会记录 `transfer weights starts` 和 `transfer weights time`。回退路径会记录 `RFork transfer failed`。"
+"回退时会先将 vLLM 编译注册表、编译器钩子、MoE 注册表和旋转位置编码缓存恢复到尝试前状态，\n"
+"再由默认加载器构建另一个模型。模型构建与回滚默认在每个 worker 内串行执行。"
 
